title: Protect the Leadership
subtitle: The lists of names are already printed in the officers' clubs.
view-if: crisis = 1 and comrades_free >= 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.c_lead_taken = 0;
// the best-known free leader of the Zentrale's current whose fate the
// period events do not decide
var keep = ['luxemburg', 'liebknecht', 'jogiches', 'levi', 'levine', 'radek', 'hoelz', 'thalmann', 'brandler', 'fischer'];
var cs = (Q.comrades || []).filter(function (c) {
    return c.status == 'free' && c.faction != 'ecci' && keep.indexOf(c.id) < 0;
});
cs.sort(function (a, b) { return (b.faction == Q.leading_faction) - (a.faction == Q.leading_faction); });
Q.c_lead_who = cs.length ? cs[0].id : 0;
Q.c_lead_who_name = cs.length ? cs[0].name : 'a member of the Zentrale';
!}
frequency: 60
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= Protect the Leadership

Nobody has forgotten January 1919. In every crisis the Freikorps and the political police go looking for the party's leaders first, and they do not always bother with a court. The Zentrale must decide where its members sleep this week.

- @hide: Hide the leaders in safe houses.
- @openly: Lead openly, in the streets.

@hide
subtitle: The leadership is safe and out of sight. The orders go out a day late.
on-arrival: {!
Q.repression -= 4;
Q.crisis_momentum -= 2;
!}

The leaders move every night, from a doctor's flat in Charlottenburg to a gardener's hut in Treptow.

@openly
subtitle: The workers see their leaders with them. So do the police: they may take [+ c_lead_who_name +].
on-arrival: {!
Q.crisis_momentum += 6;
Q.militancy += 3;
if (Q.c_lead_who && Math.random() < 0.3) {
    Q.c_lead_taken = 1;
    RG.arrest(Q.c_lead_who, 4, {news: Q.c_lead_who_name + ' arrested at a factory meeting', priority: 2});
}
!}

The Zentrale's members speak from lorries at the factory gates. [? if c_lead_taken = 1 : On the third day the police pull [+ c_lead_who_name +] down from the lorry. ?][? if c_lead_taken = 0 : Plain-clothes men in the crowd write down the times and places. ?]
